// METADATA [METADATA]
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// 3-Block Data Structure: Identity and context for this configuration
//
// Section order: Identity → State → Attribution → Location → Derivation → Classification → Intent → Grounding → Dependencies → Roadmap
// Flow: who → when → by whom → where → from what → tagged as → why → grounded in → needs → going where
//
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// # M.1 Core Identity [IDENTITY]
//
//   File identification and component classification.
//   Defines who this file is and what role it plays.
//
//   Key:       [PROJECT]-DATA-[CATEGORY]-[NAME] — Unique identifier
//   Title:     [Descriptive title]
//   Type:      [Template | Document | Code | Data]
//   Component: [Ladder | Baton | Rails] — builds up | passes between | guides
//   Role:      [Responsibility in system]
//
// Key: B-void-planning-workflow-file-creation
// Title: File Creation Workflow — Template-First Patterns
//
// Type: Document
// Component: Rails — guides file creation process
// Role: Defines how new files are created from templates — never write from scratch
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.2 Lifecycle State [STATE]
//
//   Current status and version tracking.
//   Tracks when file was created, updated, and its maturity.
//
//   Status:   [Draft | Active | Deprecated | Archived]
//   Version:  [a|b|c]-[PHASE].[COMPLETION] — (a) unstable, (b) baseline, (c) stable
//   Created:  [YYYY-MM-DD]
//   Updated:  [YYYY-MM-DD]
//
// Status: Active
// Version: a-01.02
//
// Created: 2025-12-11
// Updated: 2026-02-01
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

